            temperament: (flight_m: 60, boldness: 0.7),
            notes: "Faced with wolves the herd makes a ring, horns out and calves inside; the bulls crash heads at the rut with a crack heard a kilometre off. Its underwool (qiviut) is warmer than sheep's wool. Gone from Eurasia but for Taimyr some three thousand years ago.",
